Please note:

The size of data set is nearly 500 mb and can't be uploaded on Git.
1. You can download data set csv file via link:
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Kb78mAWYKcYlellTGhIjPI-bCcKbGuTn/view?usp=sharing
2. Rename downloaded csv into data.csv

